{{Codex|Steady and reliable, the Vasto revolver combines speed and power for a classic gunslinger feel.}}

The '''Vasto''' is a powerful and effective revolver. Striking a balance in damage and fire rate between the {{Weapon|Lato}} and the {{Weapon|Lex}}, it also sports a high [[critical chance]], good accuracy, and a short reload, but suffers from low ammo capacity and moderate recoil.

This weapon can be sold for {{cc|5,000}}. It is also a [[weapon crafting ingredient]] for the akimbo variant {{Weapon|Akvasto}} (x2) and {{Weapon|Redeemer}}.
{{Checklist|nocategory=true|
* {{Weapon|Vasto}} + {{Weapon|Vasto}} → {{Weapon|Akvasto}}
* {{Weapon|Dual Skana}} + {{Weapon|Vasto}} → {{Weapon|Redeemer}}
}}

